# The image Worker consumes the built OpenXML executable and package sources.
# Do not send the full slideclone skill tree (examples, local renders, or user
# artifacts) to Docker: the SDK stage needs only the package-owned
# OpenXmlDeckBuilder source.
**
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!packages/
!packages/**
!packages/slideclone-native-engine/**
!packages/slideclone-native-engine/dotnet/
!packages/slideclone-native-engine/dotnet/OpenXmlDeckBuilder/
!packages/slideclone-native-engine/dotnet/OpenXmlDeckBuilder/**
# `dotnet publish` runs inside the SDK stage. Local bin/ and obj/ outputs can
# contain platform-specific OCR/ONNX binaries totaling multiple GiB; they are
# neither reproducible image inputs nor safe to copy into the build context.
packages/slideclone-native-engine/dotnet/OpenXmlDeckBuilder/bin/
packages/slideclone-native-engine/dotnet/OpenXmlDeckBuilder/bin/**
packages/slideclone-native-engine/dotnet/OpenXmlDeckBuilder/obj/
packages/slideclone-native-engine/dotnet/OpenXmlDeckBuilder/obj/**
